  <h2>What this is</h2>
  <p>
    Stress isn't an event — it's a physiological state. For men navigating career peaks,
    relationship complexity, and body changes simultaneously, the HPA axis rarely fully
    recovers between demands. The result is a chronically elevated cortisol baseline that
    quietly degrades sleep, metabolism, and cognition.
  </p>
  <p>
    The 4M approach targets the nervous system directly through breath, movement, and
    structured recovery — not avoidance or medication-first. The goal is resilience:
    a system that ramps up fast and recovers just as fast.
  </p>

